# Operator UI

The panel is the judge-facing HUD and the no-glasses environment.

- Hero is the whisper card (name, banked facts, one research line).
- Header shows `glasses` vs `browser`. Start button: `Start GPT Live · browser mic`.
- Memory ledger: people, facts, timestamps, source. No bystander transcripts.
- Do not add a typed chat composer — that scores us as a wrapper (criterion 2).
- Second-pass / “ask about X on re-encounter” is P2. Coach/roast is P1.

Keep copy short. The card is verbatim ground truth; audio may paraphrase.
